  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\">本模组使玻璃瓶在使用时会消耗水源方块。这有助于防止在水源不应无限复制的整合包中出现水源复制问题。同时鼓励玩家使用炼药锅装水，因为相比直接取用源水方块，炼药锅的效率更高。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>喜欢这个模组并想支持我？</strong></p><ul>\n<li>在<a href=\"https://twitter.com/DarkhaxDev\" rel=\"nofollow\">推特</a>关注我</li>\n<li>加入我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>频道</li>\n<li>在<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>赞助</li>\n<li>访问我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">官网</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252fdarkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://nodecraft.com/assets/images/logo-dark.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"90\"></a><br>本项目由Nodecraft赞助。使用优惠码<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252fdarkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Darkhax</a>可享首月服务30%折扣！</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
